{"ID":"20240118151313-8qm83jb","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151313-8qm83jb","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151313-8qm83jb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151313-n0id9io\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240129160917-0odm9rx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122093722-mlbhj0c\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:465,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:465\u0026#125;","title":"076景天","type":"doc","updated":"20240129160724"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151313-n0id9io","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151313-n0id9io","updated":"20240122093706"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦平，主大热，火创身热烦邪恶气华，主女人漏下赤白，轻身明目。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122093708-opkns85","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122093708-opkns85"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】多自生于高山上，庭中盆景俱可栽种，叶入药。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122093710-osomhki","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122093710-osomhki"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦甘，性寒。无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122093713-y069vyp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122093713-y069vyp"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】景天主治肿疡蜂螫，能吸脓拔毒。消毒止血药，火疮，丹毒，风疹、狂热赤眼，脑膜炎头痛。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122093715-o4j4jmw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122093715-o4j4jmw"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【括要】治虫毒蜂螫，傅肿伤，吸脓拔毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122093716-swx6u85","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122093716-swx6u85"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】风疹恶疮，小儿丹毒及发热。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122093718-ps5z40k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122093718-ps5z40k"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【弘景】疗金疮止血。煎水浴小儿，去烦热惊风。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122093719-wg189nt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122093719-wg189nt"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通一钱，外用无定量。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122093721-r31w1c4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122093721-r31w1c4"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】为外用药，少内服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122093722-xnor4jn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122093722-xnor4jn"}},{"ID":"20240122093722-qcf5pw1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122093722-qcf5pw1"}},{"ID":"20240122093722-696nmd7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122093722-696nmd7","updated":"20240129160554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第76味药，景天。景天呢大部分都是用在外科，内科很少用，都是用在外科上，敷的。那这个药呢也是我们取叶子的部分，它的味苦甘，专门治疗被蜜蜂毒蜂咬伤，能够拔脓吸毒，蝎子咬伤，景天，还有那个火烧伤，火的烫伤，刀疮刀伤，都可以用，尤其治疗这个毒的蜜蜂效果最好，毒蜜蜂啊，还有那个蝎子啊，毒蜘蛛咬到，我们用这个效果都很好。这个外敷的，就是撒到伤口上面的，过去呢蜜蜂咬到用童子便，小孩子撒尿什么的，你找不到童子便怎么办，童子便也不好找，现在年轻人比较早点这个开放的，比较开放点，童子尿不好找。"}]},{"ID":"20240122093722-mlbhj0c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122093722-mlbhj0c","updated":"20240129160724"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那你那个去抓景天嘛，抓景天。那像风疹，甄权呢说风疹恶疮，只要身上有疮，外敷通通可以使用。那这种专门是疗外伤…那个止血用的哦，外用，你最好还是外用，没有什么定量，外用的药没有定量，因为撒皮肤外面嘛，你看他，他如果被蚊子咬了100个包，你说外用固定一钱，撒完，99个包呢还没用，你不要那么固执，全身都可以撒。所以以后你们知道那个虎头蜂咬伤通通可以用景天。那一般来说我们外用药的时候都是熟用，所谓熟用就是炮制，烤过烤干了，炒干了也可以，反正把水分去掉，弄干了以后打粉，用药的机器打粉，打粉以后变成细粉出来敷在外面，外敷用哦很好用，所以你如果说你们想做，我们有时候这个钱哪捐到红十字会，捐给人家，好心哪，有时候被人拿去滥用，像我们在美国，我们捐红十字会，我们大家都有个概念就是你捐十块钱，真的到需要帮助的人手上只剩七毛五，中间被剥削了，都剥削了嘛，根本就没有到他们手上，所以呢你现在懂啦，那你下去买很多景天打成粉送到救防队，然后跟他说，那个蜜蜂咬伤你就给他涂，我送给你，送这种药最好了。我们休息一下，下堂课再开始。"}]},{"ID":"20240129160917-0odm9rx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129160917-0odm9rx","updated":"20240129160938"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"现在外面的景天，就是外面的红景天，其实是一样的东西；"}]}]}